WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.042
"That's not true, Jeb," said Poppy.

2
00:00:10.043 --> 00:00:12.629
"You're good at things."

3
00:00:12.630 --> 00:00:16.791
"Not like you, Poppy," said Jeb.

4
00:00:16.792 --> 00:00:20.238
"You're funny.

5
00:00:20.239 --> 00:00:24.500
Eddy is fast.

6
00:00:24.501 --> 00:00:28.355
And Dipper plays music."

7
00:00:28.356 --> 00:00:32.636
"You're good at digging dirt," said Dipper.

8
00:00:32.637 --> 00:00:35.920
"I guess," said Jeb.

9
00:00:35.921 --> 00:00:39.716
"But no one cares about digging."

10
00:00:39.717 --> 00:00:42.872
"I do!" said Eddy.

11
00:00:42.873 --> 00:00:49.437
"Dirt is fun!"

12
00:00:49.438 --> 00:00:54.676
Just then a snowflake fell.

13
00:00:54.677 --> 00:01:02.319
"It's starting to snow!" said Poppy.

14
00:01:02.320 --> 00:01:05.868
More snowflakes fell.

15
00:01:05.869 --> 00:01:10.937
"Yay!" cried Poppy.

16
00:01:10.938 --> 00:01:17.815
Eddy stuck out his tongue.

17
00:01:17.816 --> 00:01:20.433
He caught a snowflake.

18
00:01:20.434 --> 00:01:23.846
"Mmm!" said Eddy.

19
00:01:23.847 --> 00:01:29.949
Soon snow covered the ground.

20
00:01:29.950 --> 00:01:38.841
The snow got deep.

21
00:01:38.842 --> 00:01:43.151
"We're going home early!" said Mr. Grill.

22
00:01:43.152 --> 00:01:53.889
"Yay!" shouted the students.

23
00:01:53.890 --> 00:01:57.489
Poppy's tires spun in the snow.

24
00:01:57.490 --> 00:02:00.100
She didn't move.

25
00:02:00.101 --> 00:02:05.784
"Uh-oh!" said Poppy.

